WEBVTT

00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:16.640
Don't push me away

00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:17.730
Episode 10

00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:18.300
Don't tell me to go away

00:00:18.890 --> 00:00:23.000
Don't say that I bring misfortune.
Don't say I'm an animal

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:29.340
At least don't do this to me

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:35.490
You... are my man

00:00:36.910 --> 00:00:39.210
I'm not your man, your highness

00:00:39.210 --> 00:00:40.540
You are my man

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:42.410
You belong to me. You are mine!

00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:48.770
You can't leave me without my permission

00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:51.190
And you can't die either

00:00:54.140 --> 00:00:55.760
Totally my man

00:02:04.980 --> 00:02:14.980
Project coordinator, editor and translator of songs: Nemie

00:02:15.080 --> 00:02:25.080
Translators: Nemie, Kaia, tamaramin

00:02:16.990 --> 00:02:18.060
Sister?

00:02:25.180 --> 00:02:35.180
Beta Editor: Sana

00:02:30.660 --> 00:02:31.860
It can't be

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:34.040
You're wrong

00:02:35.280 --> 00:02:45.280
Typesetters: Nemie, Sana

00:02:35.280 --> 00:02:37.650
How is it that you left the palace?

00:02:40.670 --> 00:02:41.770
How?

00:02:41.770 --> 00:02:44.570
I'm sure. How could I not recognize her?

00:02:44.570 --> 00:02:46.800
I even asked the security guard

00:02:46.800 --> 00:02:48.870
How can a court lady leave the palace?!

00:02:49.640 --> 00:02:51.670
Does So care about such things?

00:02:51.670 --> 00:02:53.510
Probably took him by force

00:02:54.130 --> 00:02:56.630
If they are caught, Su's life will be in danger

00:02:56.630 --> 00:02:58.040
Let's find her

00:02:58.040 --> 00:03:00.200
Give me a horse, and then...

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:02.530
- Stay here
- What?

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:06.390
It's not good for you to drive around at night

00:03:08.020 --> 00:03:11.190
Go, I'll find them

00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:16.550
Thanks for your concern, but I won't leave

00:03:17.720 --> 00:03:19.660
It is already known that she left the palace

00:03:20.810 --> 00:03:23.190
I don't even know what will happen to her

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:25.760
Let's find them together

00:03:29.230 --> 00:03:30.270
Okay

00:03:31.490 --> 00:03:35.440
I still think of you as a child

00:03:36.970 --> 00:03:38.060
I'm sorry

00:03:40.480 --> 00:03:42.690
I trust you

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:53.830
Will you hear him?

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:59.380
The same voice that is in such a hurry to confess

00:04:00.830 --> 00:04:03.280
Are you still listening?

00:04:03.280 --> 00:04:07.430
Can you hear my heart?

00:04:05.180 --> 00:04:08.830
Neither you nor I will be safe

00:04:09.280 --> 00:04:13.550
How raindrops settled on the window

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:13.140
Then maybe we can just run away?

00:04:13.140 --> 00:04:16.030
If you want, we'll do it

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:20.000
Also my mind is consumed by you

00:04:20.750 --> 00:04:22.200
Need you

00:04:23.300 --> 00:04:24.880
Need you

00:04:25.880 --> 00:04:28.150
I miss you

00:04:25.900 --> 00:04:31.270
Even if I had to leave Songak, I wanted to bring you here

00:04:31.240 --> 00:04:34.240
Will you hear him?

00:04:34.490 --> 00:04:39.790
The same voice that is in such a hurry to confess

00:04:41.240 --> 00:04:43.690
Are you still listening?

00:04:43.690 --> 00:04:47.840
Can you hear my heart?

00:04:49.780 --> 00:04:54.050
How raindrops settled on the window

00:04:54.730 --> 00:05:00.500
Also my mind is consumed by you

00:05:01.250 --> 00:05:02.700
Need you

00:05:03.800 --> 00:05:05.380
Need you

00:05:06.380 --> 00:05:08.650
I miss you

00:05:11.100 --> 00:05:13.670
I'm always forced to leave

00:05:15.350 --> 00:05:19.020
I still don't know why this is so

00:05:20.990 --> 00:05:23.390
I've never brought misfortune

00:05:23.390 --> 00:05:26.060
And I didn’t kill animals for pleasure

00:05:26.060 --> 00:05:28.690
And people thoughtlessly too

00:05:32.390 --> 00:05:35.410
Should I leave anyway?

00:05:37.100 --> 00:05:38.440
It was just an illusion

00:05:38.440 --> 00:05:40.220
Simple illusion

00:05:40.220 --> 00:05:41.180
I shouldn't be afraid of him

00:05:41.180 --> 00:05:43.630
He can't be allowed to become reckless.

00:05:44.570 --> 00:05:49.770
I want you to live with a calm heart, Your Highness

00:05:51.320 --> 00:05:53.440
Palace or other place

00:05:54.850 --> 00:05:59.890
don't live in sorrow, don't shed blood, live in joy

00:06:01.670 --> 00:06:05.020
I will... if you come with me

00:06:06.490 --> 00:06:08.120
I'm a court lady

00:06:08.850 --> 00:06:10.510
Should live in a palace

00:06:12.110 --> 00:06:13.650
Then I won't leave

00:06:16.830 --> 00:06:18.120
Besides, I...

00:06:22.260 --> 00:06:24.340
I like another person

00:06:28.010 --> 00:06:29.080
Beck Huh?

00:06:30.810 --> 00:06:32.970
No, not Baek A

00:06:33.560 --> 00:06:36.650
Then it's ok since it's not Baek Ah

00:06:38.260 --> 00:06:42.140
If it's another man, then I can kill him

00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:45.390
What?

00:06:49.170 --> 00:06:52.160
The day Yong Hwa gave you a spanking,

00:06:52.920 --> 00:06:56.480
from that day on I considered you my man

00:06:56.480 --> 00:06:58.530
You saw what I was like

00:06:59.460 --> 00:07:02.680
There was no need to explain or justify

00:07:07.780 --> 00:07:11.390
Are you saying you're afraid? I don't believe

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:14.460
Only you are on my side

00:07:16.390 --> 00:07:18.460
That's why I don't apologize

00:07:19.990 --> 00:07:23.540
Not for the kiss, not for bringing me here

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:24.670
And one more thing

00:07:26.230 --> 00:07:29.320
If I threaten and force someone to stop loving him,

00:07:30.700 --> 00:07:32.320
I won't apologize

00:07:47.490 --> 00:07:48.610
Accept

00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:54.460
I wanted to give you something like this

00:07:54.460 --> 00:07:57.190
I was just trying to help you

00:07:58.060 --> 00:08:00.420
and never asked for your love

00:08:02.140 --> 00:08:04.050
Then try to run away from me

00:08:18.290 --> 00:08:19.860
You can throw it away if you want

00:08:55.660 --> 00:08:56.710
Sister!

00:09:03.890 --> 00:09:04.980
Su!

00:09:05.870 --> 00:09:07.820
Where are you from?

00:09:07.820 --> 00:09:09.960
Are they looking for me in the palace?

00:09:09.960 --> 00:09:12.180
Fortunately, only Uk and I know

00:09:12.180 --> 00:09:13.750
But others will soon discover

00:09:14.420 --> 00:09:15.910
Let's go back

00:09:18.060 --> 00:09:19.310
Here we go...

00:09:23.440 --> 00:09:25.060
What are you doing?

00:09:25.060 --> 00:09:27.980
I took her away, so I’ll bring her back too

00:09:27.980 --> 00:09:30.350
If someone sees you two together,

00:09:30.350 --> 00:09:32.100
rumors will start

00:09:32.100 --> 00:09:33.550
This is a problem

00:09:35.300 --> 00:09:36.370
Su

00:09:36.370 --> 00:09:39.900
The Emperor has already given it to me

00:09:40.800 --> 00:09:42.570
I am responsible for her

00:09:44.240 --> 00:09:45.860
Gave it to you?

00:09:49.710 --> 00:09:51.890
I will go with the 4th prince

00:09:55.160 --> 00:09:56.870
Don't worry, come back

00:09:57.870 --> 00:10:01.870
He said he'll take responsibility, so go ahead

00:10:06.890 --> 00:10:08.480
Will you go with him?

00:10:10.460 --> 00:10:11.500
Yes

00:10:18.300 --> 00:10:20.030
Better stick to your words

00:10:20.030 --> 00:10:23.430
Don't let Su get hurt

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:25.020
I don't want that either

00:10:38.390 --> 00:10:40.630
Brother you can't let them go

00:10:40.630 --> 00:10:42.910
There is no guarantee that Seo will head to the palace

00:10:42.940 --> 00:10:44.890
I won't let her leave with him if he does that.

00:10:46.630 --> 00:10:47.710
What?

00:10:48.310 --> 00:10:52.170
This is the last time I let her go like this

00:11:14.220 --> 00:11:16.700
Concubine... I just...

00:11:17.740 --> 00:11:21.040
I was the one who took Su away unexpectedly, don't blame her

00:11:22.020 --> 00:11:23.850
Are you saying she left the palace?

00:11:23.850 --> 00:11:26.220
The Emperor gave me responsibility and asked for help

00:11:27.180 --> 00:11:28.370
I should have left

00:11:28.370 --> 00:11:31.760
However, she is a court lady,

00:11:31.760 --> 00:11:34.310
and this may be considered a violation of the rules

00:11:34.310 --> 00:11:37.590
So, are you going to punish her?

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:41.470
- Is it necessary?
- You must return, Your Highness

00:11:41.470 --> 00:11:44.650
You don't need to be here to explain less to others about what happened.

00:11:45.980 --> 00:11:47.500
I trust you, concubine O

00:12:09.350 --> 00:12:13.420
Your little piece of kindness has taken up too much space in the 4th prince's heart

00:12:14.670 --> 00:12:17.950
That's why I said that you don't fit in this place.

00:12:17.950 --> 00:12:21.090
In the palace you can't just show your kindness to anyone

00:12:21.090 --> 00:12:24.650
You need to watch your every step, as if you are walking on thin ice.

00:12:26.210 --> 00:12:29.580
This is how you should live

00:12:29.580 --> 00:12:31.090
I...

00:12:32.420 --> 00:12:34.110
what should I do now?

00:12:36.270 --> 00:12:38.910
We'll have to wait for the 4th prince's feelings to cool down

00:12:53.200 --> 00:12:55.090
Bullseye!

00:13:00.920 --> 00:13:02.740
Bullseye!

00:13:19.020 --> 00:13:21.050
Bullseye!

00:13:34.350 --> 00:13:37.550
You missed the target. Now I've seen everything

00:13:37.550 --> 00:13:40.280
I need more days like this for me to improve my shooting skills

00:13:42.040 --> 00:13:45.200
I always imagine someone before I kiss

00:13:45.200 --> 00:13:47.690
The one who became a hero instead of me

00:13:47.690 --> 00:13:50.260
If I imagine how this arrow pierces the heart

00:13:50.260 --> 00:13:52.390
the one who kicked me out of my place

00:13:53.470 --> 00:13:55.230
I won't miss

00:13:57.790 --> 00:13:59.640
Bullseye!

00:14:00.900 --> 00:14:02.050
What about you?

00:14:02.960 --> 00:14:04.760
Who is your target?

00:14:04.760 --> 00:14:05.980
I never

00:14:07.720 --> 00:14:10.420
I don't think about anyone when I kiss

00:14:15.050 --> 00:14:19.350
People without a clear goal are easy to manage

00:14:19.350 --> 00:14:21.430
I'm leaving Songak

00:14:21.430 --> 00:14:26.010
The Emperor sent me to die, but I have to return alive

00:14:26.910 --> 00:14:28.780
You will be safe and sound

00:14:28.780 --> 00:14:32.790
Of course. I'll be back in perfect condition

00:14:33.790 --> 00:14:36.420
And think about it in my absence

00:14:36.420 --> 00:14:39.690
Who can be an interesting target?

00:14:43.240 --> 00:14:44.500
Do we have

00:14:45.430 --> 00:14:47.800
Isn't there something we both agree on?

00:15:58.980 --> 00:16:00.470
I'll be back soon

00:16:01.020 --> 00:16:04.840
Until then you must think carefully

00:16:04.840 --> 00:16:07.850
I'll be waiting for your return

00:16:15.420 --> 00:16:16.640
Let's go

00:16:46.480 --> 00:16:48.680
Are you angry?

00:16:51.730 --> 00:16:57.120
The 4th prince and I just went to watch the sunrise

00:16:58.010 --> 00:17:02.670
I didn't want to get you in trouble, so I came back with him.

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:08.690
I'm not angry

00:17:10.080 --> 00:17:11.640
I'm just upset

00:17:14.840 --> 00:17:19.240
I was always worried about leaving you in Damiwon

00:17:19.850 --> 00:17:23.700
And So just took you away

00:17:30.630 --> 00:17:34.560
I will ask the emperor to marry you

00:17:35.810 --> 00:17:37.150
Marry?

00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:41.900
When I heard that you were missing,

00:17:41.900 --> 00:17:45.070
I remembered that you came here to marry the emperor

00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:50.530
You don't know how worried I was that I might lose you again

00:17:50.530 --> 00:17:54.350
I don't want to repeat the mistake again

00:17:59.530 --> 00:18:01.070
Just like my wife said,

00:18:02.590 --> 00:18:05.480
I could never sleep peacefully

00:18:05.480 --> 00:18:10.010
Too much is expected of me, the future worries me

00:18:11.720 --> 00:18:15.050
Even sleep is considered a crime by me.

00:18:15.980 --> 00:18:21.250
You brought back laughter and joy to such a person

00:18:21.250 --> 00:18:25.750
And... she gave me a poem

00:18:28.850 --> 00:18:30.050
It was you

00:18:32.990 --> 00:18:35.900
I want to leave the palace and live happily with you in Hwangju

00:18:38.500 --> 00:18:43.130
I want to live, giving you the love that I didn’t give to my wife

00:18:43.130 --> 00:18:44.410
Su,

00:18:46.820 --> 00:18:48.490
will you become my wife?

00:18:52.660 --> 00:18:54.580
He won't change

00:18:55.220 --> 00:18:57.010
Won't hurt me

00:18:57.670 --> 00:19:01.670
I'll be happy with him

00:19:04.810 --> 00:19:07.630
If Gwangjong kills him...

00:19:11.210 --> 00:19:13.890
Don't you want to be with me anymore?

00:19:13.890 --> 00:19:15.410
No, that's not true!

00:19:15.410 --> 00:19:19.480
So you don't believe my promise?

00:19:23.030 --> 00:19:24.250
Everything is wrong...

00:19:29.720 --> 00:19:31.290
Then will you answer me?

00:19:34.900 --> 00:19:36.380
Will you marry me?

00:19:40.170 --> 00:19:42.140
What's going on here?

00:19:48.010 --> 00:19:52.650
The girl who spied on the princes while swimming... it's you!

00:19:53.750 --> 00:19:55.650
Sorry, concubine O

00:19:56.180 --> 00:19:58.410
Concubine Oh, I'll explain

00:19:58.410 --> 00:20:00.330
If this secret meeting becomes known,

00:20:00.330 --> 00:20:02.900
Who do you think will be executed first?

00:20:04.750 --> 00:20:06.900
This place will be closed soon

00:20:06.900 --> 00:20:10.090
Relationships with a court lady entail

00:20:10.090 --> 00:20:12.050
loss of status and severe punishment

00:20:13.260 --> 00:20:14.300
Let's go

00:20:29.280 --> 00:20:32.810
I want you to leave the palace with me

00:20:33.940 --> 00:20:34.970
What?

00:20:34.970 --> 00:20:37.410
The doctor recommended that I leave the palace,

00:20:37.410 --> 00:20:39.240
to restore strength and health

00:20:40.330 --> 00:20:43.880
Come to my hometown with me, okay?

00:20:46.030 --> 00:20:49.060
I was afraid that you were in a relationship with Prince Wang Wook

00:20:50.690 --> 00:20:52.780
The best thing to do now is to avoid him.

00:20:52.780 --> 00:20:54.780
8th Prince

00:20:58.270 --> 00:21:01.150
asked me to marry him, and I thought about a positive answer

00:21:01.150 --> 00:21:02.780
Think about the 4th prince!

00:21:02.780 --> 00:21:05.370
Do you think you can survive between the two of them?

00:21:05.650 --> 00:21:09.130
If either of them's feelings change, your life will be in danger.

00:21:09.130 --> 00:21:10.620
8th Prince is different

00:21:10.620 --> 00:21:12.860
- His feelings will remain the same
- No!

00:21:13.450 --> 00:21:15.430
A palace is a place that makes people

00:21:15.430 --> 00:21:17.260
take back your words and promises

00:21:19.060 --> 00:21:21.270
That unknown general to whom I gave my heart...

00:21:22.490 --> 00:21:23.610
Yes

00:21:24.420 --> 00:21:27.150
As you might have guessed, he sits on the throne

00:21:28.650 --> 00:21:33.720
He wanted to marry me, but he had to protect the throne

00:21:33.720 --> 00:21:37.420
So he forgot about the small town herbal dealer's daughter

00:21:37.930 --> 00:21:39.950
But I still wanted to be near him

00:21:39.950 --> 00:21:44.170
And I made a promise to live like a court lady, not like a woman

00:21:45.560 --> 00:21:49.010
I make tea and wash his hair

00:21:49.010 --> 00:21:50.670
I prepare his clothes and dress him

00:21:52.580 --> 00:21:54.890
I call my lover "Your Majesty"

00:21:55.790 --> 00:21:58.530
I wash the bodies of the women he owns

00:22:06.570 --> 00:22:10.160
Su, take a step back and look around

00:22:10.160 --> 00:22:12.780
You could be in danger if you don't leave this place now.

00:22:15.360 --> 00:22:20.230
The 8th Prince asked me to leave the palace and go to Hwangju

00:22:20.230 --> 00:22:22.280
While he has no desire to seize the throne,

00:22:22.280 --> 00:22:23.680
we can be happy

00:22:23.680 --> 00:22:25.770
I trust him

00:23:18.380 --> 00:23:20.330
I came to see if you're okay

00:23:23.950 --> 00:23:26.030
I'll talk to concubine O

00:23:26.620 --> 00:23:27.950
You need to rest today

00:23:31.800 --> 00:23:33.060
Your Highness

00:23:36.830 --> 00:23:38.470
Sign in

00:23:39.400 --> 00:23:40.850
I will help you

00:23:51.730 --> 00:23:55.220
I don't hate you or fear you, prince

00:23:56.400 --> 00:23:57.530
Don't worry

00:23:59.400 --> 00:24:02.240
Usually people

00:24:03.200 --> 00:24:06.960
cling very tightly to a person,

00:24:06.960 --> 00:24:08.370
who helped them in difficult times

00:24:10.480 --> 00:24:13.240
They think that only this person is on their side

00:24:14.050 --> 00:24:15.330
This man...

00:24:17.150 --> 00:24:18.910
they call him a friend

00:24:22.670 --> 00:24:26.090
Both love and friendship are a kind of sympathy, but...

00:24:27.730 --> 00:24:30.390
They are different. Completely different

00:24:32.230 --> 00:24:36.740
I'm afraid you're a little confused about these sympathies

00:24:36.740 --> 00:24:38.080
That's why I'm worried

00:24:47.650 --> 00:24:49.430
I'm actually worried

00:24:53.120 --> 00:24:59.140
Maybe I couldn’t say then

00:24:53.790 --> 00:24:57.520
I don't understand the difference between these feelings

00:24:58.560 --> 00:25:00.430
Friendship or love

00:24:59.140 --> 00:25:04.240
I kept everything a secret, I'm like this

00:25:01.250 --> 00:25:02.930
for me it's the same thing

00:25:04.250 --> 00:25:05.400
One feeling

00:25:05.590 --> 00:25:11.470
How did it all start and when did it begin?

00:25:11.470 --> 00:25:17.020
It's so hard to remember, but now I'm with you

00:25:16.820 --> 00:25:19.240
It seems like you're trying to push me away

00:25:17.340 --> 00:25:23.470
Do you think the same as me, I wonder?

00:25:20.460 --> 00:25:22.510
These methods don't work for me.

00:25:23.470 --> 00:25:29.070
This is the only thing that worries me now

00:25:29.390 --> 00:25:35.340
This all looks so much like love, since I didn’t know

00:25:31.950 --> 00:25:33.880
I told you to get ready

00:25:35.620 --> 00:25:41.140
Now throw away your worries and hug

00:25:41.490 --> 00:25:47.920
If the heart is beating, it's love, yes

00:25:46.140 --> 00:25:47.460
Don't worry

00:25:47.970 --> 00:25:53.790
Then just admit it to me

00:25:48.340 --> 00:25:50.320
I won't do this again without your permission.

00:26:09.180 --> 00:26:10.290
Sister Su!

00:26:12.580 --> 00:26:13.780
Cham cham cham!

00:26:13.780 --> 00:26:15.590
Oh, that's better

00:26:15.670 --> 00:26:18.270
It would be stupid of me not to improve my skills after such a beating.

00:26:18.270 --> 00:26:19.290
Cham cham cham!

00:26:19.890 --> 00:26:20.930
Yes!

00:26:21.800 --> 00:26:23.920
Here, you can hit with all your might

00:26:26.370 --> 00:26:29.150
I'll be taken away if they see a lady of the court hitting a prince

00:26:29.150 --> 00:26:32.740
By the way, I was so scared when I saw that you were taken by my 4th brother

00:26:32.740 --> 00:26:34.260
Weren't you hurt?

00:26:34.260 --> 00:26:36.410
Where did he take you?

00:26:36.410 --> 00:26:38.690
We just went for a ride to get some fresh air

00:26:38.690 --> 00:26:40.340
It was a lot of fun

00:26:40.340 --> 00:26:43.650
He always does things his way

00:26:43.650 --> 00:26:44.940
I don't like it

00:26:45.490 --> 00:26:48.430
Try to understand your brother a little

00:26:49.070 --> 00:26:52.080
You grew up in great love, prince

00:26:52.080 --> 00:26:54.130
But he didn't receive it

00:26:54.790 --> 00:26:56.650
He didn't have a real family

00:26:56.650 --> 00:26:58.370
It's not easy to get kindness from people

00:26:58.370 --> 00:27:01.010
It is also deserved by efforts

00:27:02.160 --> 00:27:07.290
Since Seo returned to Songak, both Mom and Yeo have changed a lot.

00:27:08.130 --> 00:27:10.390
You don't blame the 4th prince for this, do you?

00:27:10.390 --> 00:27:12.630
I know it's not all his fault

00:27:13.590 --> 00:27:15.260
If it weren't for him,

00:27:15.260 --> 00:27:18.110
I would not have known about the worries that my mother and brother Yo were causing

00:27:19.630 --> 00:27:22.890
Sister, I really miss the past

00:27:23.570 --> 00:27:25.890
You know, when we spent time together

00:27:25.890 --> 00:27:28.980
You were most beautiful when you smiled while living in Uka's house

00:27:30.240 --> 00:27:32.660
I think about this often too

00:27:34.720 --> 00:27:36.230
I want to go back

00:27:41.980 --> 00:27:44.280
What did you just say?

00:27:44.280 --> 00:27:46.450
On the holiday of the 9th day of the 9th lunar month

00:27:46.450 --> 00:27:48.870
I will get the emperor's permission to marry Hae Soo

00:27:51.110 --> 00:27:54.360
If she agrees to leave the palace, I will live with her in Hwangju

00:27:55.660 --> 00:28:00.450
I know my family has big plans for me, but I don't need the throne.

00:28:03.250 --> 00:28:05.580
Palace politics disgusts me

00:28:05.580 --> 00:28:09.840
I just want to live in peace

00:28:09.840 --> 00:28:11.700
Do you want to give up the throne?

00:28:11.700 --> 00:28:15.670
Do you want to not care about mom and me and just live like an ordinary person?

00:28:15.670 --> 00:28:17.060
What about us?

00:28:17.060 --> 00:28:19.100
Who will protect Hwangbo's house?!

00:28:19.100 --> 00:28:22.350
There are many ways to protect our home. I don't have to become emperor

00:28:25.660 --> 00:28:26.730
Trust me

00:28:30.220 --> 00:28:33.700
Have I ever stopped you from doing as you please?

00:28:34.560 --> 00:28:37.060
If you are sure of what you want, then go ahead.

00:28:37.060 --> 00:28:38.720
Make her yours

00:28:39.630 --> 00:28:44.010
However, it won't be easy.
You must be well prepared

00:28:44.650 --> 00:28:48.450
Su will be very grateful to you, mom

00:28:56.790 --> 00:29:00.480
He needed to be stopped. You should have stopped him, Mom!

00:29:01.680 --> 00:29:04.610
Even I'm tired of the battles for the throne

00:29:04.610 --> 00:29:06.290
How do you think he feels?

00:29:07.460 --> 00:29:11.630
There is a very heavy load on him, you can’t even imagine what it is.

00:29:13.140 --> 00:29:15.050
Let's let him do as he pleases.

00:29:16.080 --> 00:29:19.050
You were exiled for causing a miscarriage

00:29:19.050 --> 00:29:20.690
from the concubine whom the emperor loved

00:29:20.690 --> 00:29:22.370
This was just 10 years ago

00:29:22.370 --> 00:29:26.640
Everyone knows that Empress Yu did it, but no one took our side

00:29:26.940 --> 00:29:29.620
Concubine Kang, Concubine Park

00:29:29.620 --> 00:29:31.520
Concubine Hong, Concubine Wang!

00:29:32.020 --> 00:29:36.090
If we don't take the throne, they will attack again!

00:29:36.090 --> 00:29:37.960
Crown Prince Mu is different from the Emperor

00:29:37.960 --> 00:29:39.490
And the country will become different

00:29:39.490 --> 00:29:42.910
Don't let unreasonable fears and worries get the better of you

00:29:49.350 --> 00:29:54.300
I think it's time to step out from under your wing, Mom.

00:29:56.450 --> 00:29:57.640
Yong Hwa

00:29:58.920 --> 00:30:01.870
From now on I have a new goal

00:30:02.300 --> 00:30:04.960
I will no longer be the emperor's daughter or sister

00:30:04.960 --> 00:30:07.300
I will be like a deity who has power over the emperor

00:30:10.380 --> 00:30:12.590
There's no need to forgive me

00:30:25.540 --> 00:30:28.940
Empress, Princess Yeon Hwa has come to see you.

00:30:29.500 --> 00:30:31.040
Princess Yeon Hwa?

00:30:39.390 --> 00:30:42.650
You told me to visit you and tell you funny stories

00:30:43.640 --> 00:30:46.760
I want to tell you one thing today

00:30:48.180 --> 00:30:49.360
Really?

00:30:51.130 --> 00:30:55.160
If you insist, I guess I should listen to her.

00:30:56.430 --> 00:30:57.680
I'm looking forward to it

00:31:08.340 --> 00:31:12.200
I heard there's a new girl

00:31:12.670 --> 00:31:15.710
If I don't recognize her, then she's not a dancer

00:31:15.710 --> 00:31:17.790
Let's see

00:31:17.790 --> 00:31:19.710
Where...

00:31:43.640 --> 00:31:46.030
Who... is here?

00:31:56.000 --> 00:31:57.920
Have you been well, Zhong Ziqi?

00:31:57.920 --> 00:31:59.540
Why are you here?

00:32:00.300 --> 00:32:04.000
Who hired you to follow me?

00:32:04.000 --> 00:32:05.250
Who are you?

00:32:05.250 --> 00:32:07.800
I just came to play for the dancers

00:32:07.800 --> 00:32:10.020
- Why follow you?
- Is it true?

00:32:10.020 --> 00:32:14.160
It's you who always follows me, Zhong Ziqi

00:32:14.160 --> 00:32:15.460
Don't remember?

00:32:17.150 --> 00:32:19.670
I didn't know you were playing here

00:32:19.670 --> 00:32:23.930
There are a lot of things I can't do.
But there is also a lot that I can do

00:32:23.930 --> 00:32:27.720
I didn't know you were a gisaeng

00:32:27.720 --> 00:32:30.280
Because of the way you communicated, I thought you were a noblewoman

00:32:30.280 --> 00:32:33.640
Court musician or artist, just focus on work

00:32:33.640 --> 00:32:36.850
Judging other people is a bad habit

00:32:36.850 --> 00:32:39.700
We've already met three times, it's time to introduce ourselves

00:32:39.700 --> 00:32:42.410
What's your name? Zhong Ziqi?

00:32:42.410 --> 00:32:44.140
- Bok Soon
- Wu Hee!

00:32:44.140 --> 00:32:46.170
It's time to go back to the rooms

00:32:46.170 --> 00:32:47.780
Okay!

00:32:50.210 --> 00:32:51.680
Bok Soon...

00:32:52.730 --> 00:32:54.250
She's cheeky, of course.

00:32:55.370 --> 00:32:58.920
Wu Hee. Woo Hee, as they said

00:33:00.680 --> 00:33:02.960
And what will we do?

00:33:02.960 --> 00:33:05.770
to make the Emperor and Crown Prince turn away from So?

00:33:06.590 --> 00:33:09.340
We must convince the emperor

00:33:09.340 --> 00:33:12.010
that the 4th prince is a rival to the crown prince

00:33:12.010 --> 00:33:16.650
Pretend you support the 4th prince

00:33:14.630 --> 00:33:18.280
Minister Park Young Gyu

00:33:16.650 --> 00:33:19.610
Then I'll do the rest, empress

00:33:19.610 --> 00:33:23.580
I handed over the papers regarding the Crown Prince's uncle to the 4th Prince

00:33:23.580 --> 00:33:28.010
When these papers are revealed, the Crown Prince will suspect the 4th

00:33:28.960 --> 00:33:32.650
Yeo is currently in Seogyeong meeting with Wang Sik Ryeom

00:33:33.220 --> 00:33:35.300
Everything is perfect

00:33:36.160 --> 00:33:39.370
We need to hurry up. Fine

00:33:41.680 --> 00:33:44.110
Why would the Crown Prince visit his mother's family?

00:33:44.110 --> 00:33:46.610
There are some issues he needs to sort out.

00:33:47.140 --> 00:33:48.970
There's no need to bring this up

00:33:48.970 --> 00:33:50.890
Yes, but brother

00:33:52.360 --> 00:33:56.150
Is it true that you took Su away from the palace?

00:33:59.690 --> 00:34:01.390
She's a court lady

00:34:01.390 --> 00:34:04.690
If you treat her like an ordinary girl, both you and she will end up in trouble.

00:34:04.690 --> 00:34:06.500
Don't make life difficult for her

00:34:06.500 --> 00:34:08.290
I wasn't trying to get her into trouble

00:34:08.290 --> 00:34:11.190
And it wasn’t my intention to complicate her life

00:34:12.440 --> 00:34:15.850
I just made a mistake

00:34:17.200 --> 00:34:19.230
I don't know how to build relationships with people

00:34:22.080 --> 00:34:23.880
Can I be criticized for this?

00:34:26.160 --> 00:34:31.360
I didn't know you cared so much about Su

00:34:36.860 --> 00:34:41.720
In this world I only have you and her

00:34:43.690 --> 00:34:46.600
Your Highness! Your Highness!

00:34:49.550 --> 00:34:52.010
Jeongdeokjeong Palace is in uprising

00:34:52.380 --> 00:34:56.350
The family of the crown prince's mother stole money from the people twice

00:34:57.290 --> 00:35:01.020
Many powerful families want you to remove Crown Prince Mu

00:35:16.870 --> 00:35:20.290
Crown Prince Mu, did you know about the embezzlement?

00:35:21.170 --> 00:35:24.310
We have information that you were there when they came to collect their share of the money.

00:35:24.310 --> 00:35:26.540
I found out about everything later

00:35:26.540 --> 00:35:28.630
Maybe they miscalculated their part

00:35:29.250 --> 00:35:31.550
You shouldn't talk like that

00:35:31.580 --> 00:35:33.970
No one planned to steal from the residents who work so hard

00:35:33.970 --> 00:35:36.130
Don't try to make false accusations

00:35:36.650 --> 00:35:38.580
His Highness found out about this later

00:35:38.580 --> 00:35:41.950
And is it also not true that your family is mired in bribery?

00:35:43.110 --> 00:35:44.290
Emperor

00:35:44.290 --> 00:35:48.960
We no longer want to entrust the future of our country to

00:35:48.960 --> 00:35:50.370
immoral crown prince

00:35:50.370 --> 00:35:53.740
- Please consider our request
- Please consider our request

00:35:58.660 --> 00:35:59.840
If so,

00:36:01.160 --> 00:36:04.090
Who would you like to see in Prince Mu's place?

00:36:08.150 --> 00:36:10.090
Your... Your Majesty?

00:36:10.790 --> 00:36:13.420
Are you saying that you will overthrow the crown prince?

00:36:13.420 --> 00:36:18.550
To overthrow the prince, I need another candidate to take his place.

00:36:20.160 --> 00:36:22.780
So I tell you to recommend another prince,

00:36:22.780 --> 00:36:26.200
who can best rule Goryeo

00:36:28.780 --> 00:36:32.850
Emperor, I believe the 4th Prince is the best fit

00:36:33.870 --> 00:36:36.540
4th prince? Wang So?

00:36:36.540 --> 00:36:39.420
Prince Wang So was adopted

00:36:39.420 --> 00:36:42.560
He will have no maternal relatives who can tarnish his reputation

00:36:43.180 --> 00:36:44.790
He also performed the rain ritual

00:36:44.790 --> 00:36:48.640
After this, he earned the honor and respect of the imperial family and the entire people

00:36:48.640 --> 00:36:51.420
I think he is more suitable for the role of the ruler of Goryeo than others

00:37:12.980 --> 00:37:14.800
Sorry brother

00:37:14.800 --> 00:37:16.990
I didn't think it would turn out this way

00:37:16.990 --> 00:37:18.380
What are you talking about?

00:37:18.380 --> 00:37:21.820
I was just worried about you, so I told So

00:37:21.820 --> 00:37:24.450
I thought he cared about you the most

00:37:24.450 --> 00:37:28.580
Just showed him your uncle's notes

00:37:29.250 --> 00:37:32.860
Are you saying that 4th brother knew about my mother's family?

00:37:33.660 --> 00:37:36.980
I... told him myself

00:37:36.980 --> 00:37:38.070
I'm sure he knew

00:37:39.500 --> 00:37:43.320
But I didn't know it would put your position in danger

00:37:43.890 --> 00:37:45.400
Kill me brother

00:38:03.270 --> 00:38:05.840
It's time to return to Shinzhu

00:38:07.560 --> 00:38:10.050
You must leave after the 9th day of the 9th lunar month

00:38:10.050 --> 00:38:12.410
Should I?

00:38:17.680 --> 00:38:20.120
There are those who want to make you crown prince

00:38:20.920 --> 00:38:23.950
Among them is your mother, Empress Yu

00:38:25.250 --> 00:38:28.130
She's probably using you to gain the throne

00:38:28.130 --> 00:38:30.400
I don’t communicate with them, why should I leave?

00:38:30.400 --> 00:38:31.530
It's not fair

00:38:31.530 --> 00:38:34.130
The heart of man can be tricky

00:38:34.130 --> 00:38:39.080
It may not be true now, but if you continue to feel offended,

00:38:39.080 --> 00:38:42.040
you will forget all the sincerity that is in you now

00:38:43.750 --> 00:38:46.840
You were a shield from any arrows or failures,
what could have been waiting for him on the way

00:38:47.420 --> 00:38:50.080
You have no idea that your father manipulated you

00:38:55.750 --> 00:38:56.960
For you, Your Majesty,

00:38:58.160 --> 00:39:01.300
my true feelings don't matter

00:39:01.300 --> 00:39:04.110
I also want you to be with me as long as possible

00:39:04.970 --> 00:39:07.000
But what can I do?

00:39:07.000 --> 00:39:10.480
You need to cut the shoots before they grow

00:39:21.780 --> 00:39:23.800
This is the whole palace

00:39:49.570 --> 00:39:51.760
This should be served by that girl

00:39:55.160 --> 00:39:56.300
Yes, concubine

00:40:03.710 --> 00:40:05.860
I did everything as ordered

00:40:09.540 --> 00:40:13.340
The Empress must not know anything about this matter.

00:40:13.340 --> 00:40:14.680
Yes, prince...

00:40:17.230 --> 00:40:18.870
I understood

00:40:39.950 --> 00:40:42.690
Are you tired of bothering me yet?

00:40:42.690 --> 00:40:45.230
When will you leave me alone?!

00:40:46.610 --> 00:40:48.700
Didn't you want to become an emperor?

00:40:50.190 --> 00:40:52.950
Mother must help her son's wishes come true

00:40:53.940 --> 00:40:55.440
Don't worry

00:40:55.440 --> 00:40:58.860
The throne will be yours if everything goes according to plan

00:40:58.860 --> 00:41:01.400
Enough of these lies you feed me

00:41:02.040 --> 00:41:06.600
I don't know what you're planning, but it won't work.

00:41:06.600 --> 00:41:10.570
The Crown Prince will die on the 9th day of the 9th lunar month

00:41:11.300 --> 00:41:13.970
I've already sent poison for him

00:41:15.470 --> 00:41:18.170
Will enjoy the tea, you won't be able to stop him

00:41:18.170 --> 00:41:20.310
Do you think that after learning this, I won’t do anything?

00:41:21.070 --> 00:41:23.480
When they ask how you found out about the poison, what do you say?

00:41:24.290 --> 00:41:25.770
From your mother?

00:41:25.770 --> 00:41:28.820
If it's necessary, I'll tell you

00:41:28.820 --> 00:41:30.130
Yes?

00:41:30.850 --> 00:41:35.340
And I will say that I did this so that you could take the throne

00:41:35.340 --> 00:41:37.850
To make you emperor

00:41:37.850 --> 00:41:42.670
our whole family became so corrupt that they decided to poison the crown prince

00:41:44.000 --> 00:41:47.540
We have already decided that we will ask the emperor for you

00:41:48.310 --> 00:41:49.990
This is the whole palace

00:41:50.550 --> 00:41:54.460
Everything will work only if we gnaw each other's tails

00:41:55.350 --> 00:41:57.910
Try to stop it if you can

00:41:59.250 --> 00:42:03.050
You will feel a noose around your neck that binds you

00:42:06.880 --> 00:42:09.070
Nothing will happen according to you

00:42:11.320 --> 00:42:13.760
The Emperor kicked you out, you still don’t realize it?

00:42:15.870 --> 00:42:20.190
The maid who brings the tea will die and there will be no crown prince.

00:42:20.190 --> 00:42:22.210
And you will take over everything

00:42:29.990 --> 00:42:34.100
How... can I trust you?

00:42:34.100 --> 00:42:35.790
You said so yourself

00:42:37.060 --> 00:42:40.490
Even if you take the throne, you will not kill your brothers

00:42:40.490 --> 00:42:42.090
I trust you

00:42:43.660 --> 00:42:45.620
That's why I support

00:42:59.980 --> 00:43:03.110
Why did the crown prince's star fade?

00:43:10.790 --> 00:43:12.520
I asked you to wait

00:43:12.520 --> 00:43:14.120
Why did you insist so much on the meeting?

00:43:14.120 --> 00:43:15.930
Ask quickly

00:43:16.140 --> 00:43:18.430
For the great escape we need to change ship

00:43:20.300 --> 00:43:22.990
This is Goryeo, we are in the imperial palace

00:43:23.300 --> 00:43:25.050
It's not that simple

00:43:25.050 --> 00:43:26.930
Forget about intrigue

00:43:27.580 --> 00:43:29.800
If you don't help kill the emperor,

00:43:29.800 --> 00:43:33.930
all the people of Hupakje will know about your affairs

00:43:35.510 --> 00:43:37.930
Will you be able to survive then?

00:43:38.860 --> 00:43:44.020
As a child, when you called me "uncle", you were cute

00:43:45.210 --> 00:43:47.260
Even if I don't help,

00:43:47.260 --> 00:43:50.330
what can you do?

00:43:50.990 --> 00:43:53.510
I knew you wouldn't agree so easily

00:44:02.020 --> 00:44:04.360
How can you treat a court gisaeng like that?!

00:44:04.360 --> 00:44:05.610
Please maintain your dignity!

00:44:05.610 --> 00:44:07.700
I'll keep it a secret!

00:44:07.700 --> 00:44:10.240
This is the court musician

00:44:10.240 --> 00:44:12.730
Oh you little one..!

00:44:12.730 --> 00:44:14.670
I thought you were cute

00:44:14.670 --> 00:44:16.100
Get out!

00:44:28.680 --> 00:44:31.570
This man...

00:44:36.500 --> 00:44:38.860
Hey! Are you okay?

00:44:38.860 --> 00:44:40.820
If you want to pretend you didn't see anything, do so

00:44:40.820 --> 00:44:42.140
Be a virtue

00:44:42.140 --> 00:44:44.320
So you don't need my help

00:44:44.320 --> 00:44:48.080
With your skills you can have a great time here

00:44:50.480 --> 00:44:52.230
This is yours, isn't it?

00:44:54.460 --> 00:44:56.780
Apparently she wasn't going to look

00:45:10.080 --> 00:45:13.310
Whatever you become if we meet again,

00:45:13.310 --> 00:45:17.430
I won't forget to repay you, wife

00:45:18.600 --> 00:45:22.640
I will keep my promise to you

00:45:24.010 --> 00:45:27.500
I will love Hae Soo

00:45:28.500 --> 00:45:30.240
Look after us please

00:45:39.430 --> 00:45:40.990
Drink with your hands intertwined

00:45:40.990 --> 00:45:42.820
This is what happened

00:45:42.820 --> 00:45:44.250
Well let's

00:45:44.250 --> 00:45:46.690
Who will you choose?

00:45:46.690 --> 00:45:49.330
His Majesty has not yet been chosen

00:45:49.330 --> 00:45:52.410
I wonder if he can avoid this fate again

00:45:53.430 --> 00:45:57.900
Okay, I'll choose...

00:46:10.330 --> 00:46:14.850
Jeong. I want to drink this cup with you

00:46:17.410 --> 00:46:21.210
I don't want to! I'm a man, why should I do this?

00:46:21.210 --> 00:46:25.470
Refusal is a bad omen!

00:46:29.800 --> 00:46:30.920
Come on

00:46:47.330 --> 00:46:50.380
Then should we start?

00:46:55.080 --> 00:46:59.200
First, if the round flower rises high,

00:47:00.500 --> 00:47:03.120
then the poles of the world too

00:47:07.170 --> 00:47:08.350
Second

00:47:08.370 --> 00:47:13.250
Having no other flowers,
pure yellow earth

00:47:18.990 --> 00:47:20.050
Third

00:47:20.050 --> 00:47:23.510
What goes around comes around
such is the virtue of man

00:47:29.390 --> 00:47:30.640
Fourth

00:47:31.220 --> 00:47:35.050
A flower that can fight frost
will grow strong and even

00:47:43.230 --> 00:47:44.480
Fifth

00:47:49.400 --> 00:47:51.850
Fifth... Fifth...

00:47:52.070 --> 00:47:53.410
Fifth...

00:47:54.410 --> 00:47:55.880
- Five...
- Fifth!

00:47:58.990 --> 00:48:02.740
If there are flowers in your drinks,
the food will be fresh

00:48:03.640 --> 00:48:06.300
This is what Zhong Hui said about chrysanthemum flowers

00:48:09.200 --> 00:48:11.010
Well done, Vaughn

00:48:11.010 --> 00:48:15.140
Jeong, martial arts is good,
but don't forget about studying

00:48:16.290 --> 00:48:17.490
Yes, Your Majesty

00:48:31.320 --> 00:48:32.670
What's the matter?

00:48:32.670 --> 00:48:35.370
The Crown Prince seems to
you have no appetite today

00:48:37.600 --> 00:48:41.470
Drinking is bad today.
I apologize for the confusion this has caused.

00:48:41.470 --> 00:48:43.990
Why don't we drink chrysanthemum tea?

00:48:43.990 --> 00:48:46.610
It is known for its health benefits

00:48:47.040 --> 00:48:50.430
Concubine Oh, go and bring the prince his chrysanthemum tea

00:48:50.430 --> 00:48:52.160
Yes, I listen to you

00:49:07.760 --> 00:49:10.270
The Crown Prince wished for chrysanthemum tea

00:49:10.270 --> 00:49:11.400
Wait a minute

00:49:12.120 --> 00:49:15.420
Su, could you carry the tea for me?

00:49:15.420 --> 00:49:18.250
I think I'm about to come down with a cold

00:49:18.250 --> 00:49:19.340
I'm sorry

00:49:19.340 --> 00:49:23.060
Concubine O told me to stay away and not serve the princes

00:49:25.240 --> 00:49:26.790
So there's nothing you can do

00:49:34.690 --> 00:49:35.910
Are you okay?

00:49:42.110 --> 00:49:43.840
Faster!

00:49:43.840 --> 00:49:47.280
We are late because you took a long time to prepare, now the emperor will be upset

00:49:49.050 --> 00:49:51.040
What kind of expression is this?

00:49:51.040 --> 00:49:54.640
You don't think we're late
because I overslept?

00:49:56.770 --> 00:49:58.060
You should be ashamed

00:50:07.630 --> 00:50:09.570
Greetings, Your Highness

00:50:10.870 --> 00:50:12.410
I told you to hurry

00:50:13.560 --> 00:50:15.260
You must accept her greeting

00:50:16.740 --> 00:50:19.120
- What?
- If you don't do this...

00:50:20.400 --> 00:50:22.520
she will have to continue standing in this position

00:50:29.660 --> 00:50:31.060
Raise your head

00:50:40.770 --> 00:50:43.170
I don't want to see you. Quickly turn away

00:50:44.680 --> 00:50:45.740
Yes

00:50:46.000 --> 00:50:49.380
From now on, always turn away
whenever we see each other

00:50:49.380 --> 00:50:50.570
Do you understand?

00:50:54.010 --> 00:50:55.920
I'm in a bad mood so I'm going back

00:50:58.410 --> 00:51:00.510
You can stay or come with me

00:51:07.760 --> 00:51:12.340
If this hurts you so much, why didn't you become his second wife?

00:51:16.870 --> 00:51:20.340
Your love is enough to
accept him that way

00:51:20.340 --> 00:51:22.840
Please keep an eye on him

00:51:23.350 --> 00:51:26.320
Try to keep him out of the way
into senseless fights in the palace

00:51:26.830 --> 00:51:29.220
He's easy to get hooked on, so don't let him get close to anyone.

00:51:29.220 --> 00:51:33.320
Now I'm his wife! You don't have to worry about it anymore!

00:51:46.030 --> 00:51:48.240
We'll check the tea first

00:52:23.080 --> 00:52:26.570
Crown Prince, I need
tell you something

00:52:33.640 --> 00:52:35.000
Then speak

00:52:39.090 --> 00:52:40.310
In fact...

00:52:59.550 --> 00:53:02.480
The maid who brings the tea will die

00:53:02.480 --> 00:53:04.990
- and there will be no crown prince
- I brought chrysanthemum tea

00:53:04.990 --> 00:53:06.230
Thank you

00:53:12.460 --> 00:53:15.310
So, were you talking about something?

00:53:17.320 --> 00:53:18.350
Yes

00:53:23.590 --> 00:53:26.130
I've been giving you trouble lately

00:53:26.130 --> 00:53:29.520
Like your brother I would like
receive three drinks from you,

00:53:29.520 --> 00:53:31.100
to strengthen our relationship

00:53:34.060 --> 00:53:35.220
Well said

00:53:36.390 --> 00:53:38.880
But this is tea, not booze.
What should we do?

00:53:38.880 --> 00:53:44.020
I think with my mood today I'll get drunk even from tea

00:53:46.820 --> 00:53:48.390
Give it to the 4th prince

00:53:48.390 --> 00:53:49.590
Yes, your highness

00:54:06.610 --> 00:54:08.090
I've done a terrible thing

00:54:12.070 --> 00:54:13.370
It's my fault

00:54:14.310 --> 00:54:17.400
Before this I touched chrysanthemum flowers and there was oil left on my hands

00:54:19.170 --> 00:54:20.590
Give me a new cup

00:54:56.410 --> 00:55:00.420
I'll drink the first one to your longevity

00:55:32.400 --> 00:55:36.060
Second for continuing your fight for Goryeo

00:55:36.060 --> 00:55:38.220
For your luck...

00:55:56.460 --> 00:55:58.960
your luck in the war

00:56:20.750 --> 00:56:22.320
It's not about the cup

00:56:23.140 --> 00:56:25.000
Have you poisoned the tea?

00:56:40.500 --> 00:56:41.770
I...

00:56:45.160 --> 00:56:46.920
I'll drink the poison you poured for me

00:57:03.750 --> 00:57:05.030
And one last thing...

00:57:06.970 --> 00:57:11.260
Whoever tries to drive a wedge between us with their dirty words, it doesn’t matter

00:57:12.890 --> 00:57:17.600
I wish our friendship will forever remain the same.

00:57:48.480 --> 00:57:51.600
I am very grateful for your sincerity

00:57:53.560 --> 00:57:56.750
Your Majesty, have you seen what kind of heart your brother has?

00:57:57.170 --> 00:58:00.210
How can I be away from a brother like him?

00:58:00.210 --> 00:58:05.060
Please cancel your order and do not send it to Shinzhu

00:58:15.500 --> 00:58:18.080
The water for tea has run out.
I'll go and get more

00:58:39.290 --> 00:58:43.040
I'll be gone for a while

00:59:44.420 --> 00:59:51.180
Thanks for watching with us!
Release group MANIA

00:59:44.420 --> 00:59:51.180
http://doramamania.mybb.ru
http://vk.com/doramamania

00:59:51.980 --> 00:59:54.400
Scarlet Hearts: Ryeo

00:59:54.460 --> 00:59:56.110
In the room of the court lady Hae Soo

00:59:56.110 --> 00:59:58.390
poison and a precious necklace were found

00:59:58.390 --> 00:59:59.710
Court Lady Hae Soo

00:59:59.710 --> 01:00:01.270
arrested for attempted murder

01:00:01.270 --> 01:00:03.470
Why did you arrest an innocent child?

01:00:03.470 --> 01:00:05.710
I think you know who's behind this

01:00:05.710 --> 01:00:08.980
What kind of person did you risk your life to protect?

01:00:08.980 --> 01:00:10.770
I won't let Su suffer

01:00:10.770 --> 01:00:12.710
I'll definitely find evidence

01:00:13.110 --> 01:00:14.630
Hae Soo

01:00:14.630 --> 01:00:18.990
will be executed for attempting to kill the prince

01:00:19.430 --> 01:00:20.650
Su!
